</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Warzone%205\">Warzone 5</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThis monster heals when receiving <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a>, including the damage dealt by the monsters and mechanics in the room (<a href=\"#/wiki/Ember%20Beast\">Ember Beasts</a>, the fire cannons, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Snail%20Slime\">Snail Slimes</a>). It summons a Snail Slime after taking some damage.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tTrap him in a corner of the room with a player on every SQM at the range of 3 SQM of the boss, this will avoid it summoning Snail Slimes when taking damage. The Snail Slimes blow up when dying and deal 1730 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a> in an small area. <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> should avoid boss beams because it reduces Magic Level.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 180 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Crystal%20Fragment\"><img alt=\"Heavy Crystal Fragment\" class=\"mw